<h1>In memorandum: TJ Porter</h1>
<h2>October 15, 2026</h2>
I remember a musician, one TJ Porter, who died a couple of years ago.
 But first, a Chess puzzle.
<a name="2026-10-15-chess-puzzle"> </a>
